{"id":364,"profile":{"ID":5070,"title":"Christina \u201cXaos Princess\u201d Kinne","content":"","attr_title":"","menu_type":"profile","url":"\/profile\/christina-xaos-princess-kinne\/","slug":"christina-xaos-princess-kinne","parent":"5069","coords":"","offset":"","confirmation_status":"","event_length_seconds":"","point_of_contact":"","guest_type":"","event_type":"","appearance_type":"","notes":"","classes":[""],"post":{"ID":364,"post_author":"1","post_date":"2021-07-19 16:10:50","post_date_gmt":"2021-07-19 16:10:50","post_content":"\u003C!-- wp:paragraph --\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChristina&nbsp;Kinne&nbsp;aka&nbsp;XaosPrincess&nbsp;graduated&nbsp;from&nbsp;Munich&nbsp;Filmschool&nbsp;in&nbsp;2006.She&nbsp;has&nbsp;worked&nbsp;as&nbsp;director,&nbsp;first&nbsp;a.d.,&nbsp;producer,&nbsp;editor,&nbsp;set&nbsp;designer,&nbsp;photographer&nbsp;and&nbsp;journalist,&nbsp;and&nbsp;has&nbsp;directed&nbsp;more&nbsp;than&nbsp;ten&nbsp;movies,&nbsp;including&nbsp;one&nbsp;of&nbsp;Europe\u2019s&nbsp;first&nbsp;live-action&nbsp;3D-films&nbsp;\u2013&nbsp;\u201cDelusion 3D\u201d&nbsp;(2008).\u003C\/p\u003E\n\u003C!-- \/wp:paragraph --\u003E\n\n\u003C!-- wp:paragraph --\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAfter&nbsp;her&nbsp;parental&nbsp;leave&nbsp;Christina&nbsp;Kinne&nbsp;found&nbsp;a&nbsp;new&nbsp;creative&nbsp;home&nbsp;in&nbsp;Virtual&nbsp;Reality.&nbsp;Using&nbsp;software&nbsp;like&nbsp;Gravity&nbsp;Sketch&nbsp;or&nbsp;Tilt&nbsp;Brush&nbsp;she&nbsp;designs&nbsp;3D&nbsp;models&nbsp;for&nbsp;VR&nbsp;in&nbsp;VR.Christina&nbsp;Kinne&nbsp;has&nbsp;produced&nbsp;and&nbsp;hosted&nbsp;a&nbsp;variety&nbsp;of&nbsp;Virtual&nbsp;Reality&nbsp;events.As&nbsp;evangelist&nbsp;she&nbsp;also&nbsp;likes&nbsp;to&nbsp;promote&nbsp;VR&nbsp;in&nbsp;real&nbsp;life&nbsp;\u2013&nbsp;be&nbsp;it&nbsp;by&nbsp;screening&nbsp;live&nbsp;VR&nbsp;content&nbsp;to&nbsp;a&nbsp;RL&nbsp;audience&nbsp;or&nbsp;by&nbsp;producing&nbsp;educational&nbsp;videos.\u003C\/p\u003E\n\u003C!-- \/wp:paragraph --\u003E\n\n\u003C!-- wp:paragraph -